[65.74780559539795,"o","\n"]
[65.74815917015076,"o","+----+------------+-----+-----------+\r\n| ID |    name    | age | is_active |\r\n+----+------------+-----+-----------+\r\n| 1  |   Sergei   |  29 |    True   |\r\n| 2  | Anna Maria |  24 |   False   |\r"]
[65.74835562705994,"o","\n+----+------------+-----+-----------+\r"]
